00:56:52.040 --> 00:57:00.990
<v Ira Glass>Seth Lind is our operations director. Emily Condon's our production manager. Elise Bergerson's our office manager. Research help today from Michelle Harris and Julie Beer. Music help from Damien Graef and Rob Geddis.

00:57:00.990 --> 00:57:25.570
