00:57:25.570 --> 00:57:28.150
<v Elias>Fine. It starts on Saturday.

00:57:28.150 --> 00:57:31.710
<v Rachel>All right, good. But can you guys shake on it? I think this is interesting.

00:57:31.710 --> 00:57:32.590
<v Theo>[SCREAMING]

00:57:32.590 --> 00:57:37.590
